members elected as independents who formally caucus with, or, for newly elected members, who announce their intent to caucus with, a party are included in that party’s count. If the caucus decisions of members of the House elected as independents cannot be determined on the date of the election, this market may remain open until the earlier of (i) an announcement from the relevant members of their intents to caucus, or (ii) January 4th, 11:59 PM ET of the following calendar year. If no such announcement is made by January 4th, 11:59 PM ET of the following calendar year, the member will not count towards the seat count of any party.\n\nThe resolution sources for this market will be official information from relevant state electoral authorities, the United States Congress, and a consensus of credible reporting.","outcomes":"[\"Yes\", \"No\"]","volume":"0","active":false,"closed":false,"marketMakerAddress":"","createdAt":"2025-07-11T19:29:42.117701Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-10T16:58:28.930403Z","new":false,"featured":false,"submitted_by":"0x91430CaD2d3975766499717fA0D66A78D814E5c5","archived":false,"resolvedBy":"0x2F5e3684cb1F318ec51b00Edba38d79Ac2c0aA9d","restricted":true,"groupItemTitle":"Other","groupItemThreshold":"8","questionID":"0xd4ec843b5228dfe0779147cf13ca9954bc22edc63876954dc2fb95fcee42ef08","enableOrderBook":true,"orderPriceMinTickSize":0.01,"orderMinSize":5,"volumeNum":0,"liquidityNum":0,"endDateIso":"2025-07-11","hasReviewedDates":true,"volume24hr":0,"volume1wk":0,"volume1mo":0,"volume1yr":0,"clobTokenIds":"[\"32806512678351792960664166512761758085909980077229801614845545250268642481454\", \"24471453313268347694105597233444552965115521151973687481592878562893509526097\"]","comboStatus":"disabled","umaBond":"10000","umaReward":"10","volume24hrAmm":0,"volume1wkAmm":0,"volume1moAmm":0,"volume1yrAmm":0,"volume24hrClob":0,"volume1wkClob":0,"volume1moClob":0,"volume1yrClob":0,"volumeAmm":0,"volumeClob":0,"liquidityAmm":0,"liquidityClob":0,"makerBaseFee":1000,"take